.TH TRACKER 1 "August 2026" "tracker 1.0.0" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
tracker \- simple project tracker by MattFor

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tracker
.RI "<command> " "[arguments] [options]"

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tracker
tracks projects by discovering Git repositories and storing project metadata.

.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR help ", " -h
Show help.

.TP
.BR version ", " -v
Show the program version.

.TP
.BR list ", " -l
List tracked projects.

.TP
.BR add ", " -a
Add a project or scan a directory for projects.

.TP
.BR remove ", " -r ", " --rm
Remove tracked projects.

.TP
.BR check ", " cc
Show project information.

.TP
.BR edit ", " -e
Edit project status or note.

.TP
.BR init ", " -i
Scan a directory for projects.

.TP
.BR settings ", " -s ", " config
View or edit settings.

.TP
.BR daemon ", " -d
Start the background daemon.

.SH PROJECT SELECTION
Projects can be selected using:
.PP
.B ID
Permanent global project ID.
.PP
.B TID
Temporary ID from the current sorted view.
.PP
.B n-x
Inclusive range.
.PP
.B n+x
Select
.I n
and the next
.I x
projects.
.PP
Project names and full or partial paths are also supported.

.SH LIST FILTERS
.TP
.B +m:value
Include partial name/path matches.

.TP
.B -m:value
Exclude partial name/path matches.

.TP
.B +r:regex
Include names matching a regex.

.TP
.B -r:regex
Exclude names matching a regex.

.SH CONFIGURATION
Tracker normally loads
.I settings.toml
from the project directory.

If
.I my_settings.toml
exists, it is used instead.

.SH DAEMON
The daemon periodically scans the directories configured under
.B [daemon]
in the settings file.

.TP
.B tracker daemon
Start the daemon.

.TP
.B tracker daemon kill
Stop all running Tracker daemons.

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
tracker
tracker list
tracker list tracker
tracker list 20
tracker add ~/Programming/Projects active "work in progress"
tracker check tracker
tracker edit 3-7 status completed
tracker remove tracker
tracker init ~/Programming
tracker settings
tracker daemon
.fi

.SH FILES
.TP
.I settings.toml
Default configuration.

.TP
.I my_settings.toml
Your own configuration.

.TP
.I data.pkl
Project database.

.SH AUTHOR
MattFor

.SH VERSION
1.0.0